    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c19ab21b-4855-55d0-945a-1938a66ddf8b" activityNameId="cc138da3-659c-5e1e-a5e8-3a38aa17e998" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Trifluoromethane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Trifluoromethane, at plant
The process "trifluoromethane, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  trifluoromethane from trichloromethane and hydrogen fluoride in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000075-46-7; 
Formula: CHF3; 
Synonyms: fluoroform, carbon trifluoride, freon 23, R-23, FE-13; 
UUID: a5da0248-74b4-3fa7-a07b-0e2666900a28
Production of trifluoromethane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Fluorination of trichloromethane
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a5da0248-74b4-3fa7-a07b-0e2666900a28.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
